    <section class="d-none card"><div class="card-body">
The results of the All American Jack&Jill prelim during SwingTime Denver 2024 in  United States of America at 08/15/2024.<br />
<br />
Judges in this round were Tashina Beckmann, Victoria Henk, Demetre Souliotes, Tatiana Mollmann, Phoenix Grey and Courtney Adair.    </div></section>

